{"5015860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anyship", "steam_appid": 5015860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anyship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  submarine, hire a crew, and explore the Seven Seas! Choose between 10 different factions like pirates, the Goblin Empire, and the Royal Navy. Battle other crews, explore dungeons, craft, fish, and mine to fill your sub with treasure and score victory points before time runs out. Each playthrough generates a new procedurally generated world with endless possibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Seven Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game creates a new map to explore. But hurry, you only have so much time to gather gold and make it to your final destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/02a029cd7d8adc73e47b2e3c968085b5.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Submarine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build a steampunk submarine with over 18 different kinds of rooms to choose from. Build everything from harpoon guns and submarine bays, to a swimming pool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/cfb7100b7edb109c67fac5c0c0c74552.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovable Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a crew from a pool of over 20 lovable and unique characters, all with their own wants, fears, and dreams. Keep them well fed and paid or you may face a mutiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/089bc052ac39bfbd5c065a29c6bdb6d1.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, battle other crews, and don't forget to eat and drink! Death is permanent, but there are many more paths to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/712b2cfa3616ec0b17942d853bbbe37a.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Acquire Booty!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, steal, mine, craft, brew, and earn gold and treasures to gain victory points! High scores as different factions will unlock completely different and unique starts to future play throughs whether you're a bard, a marine, or a merciless captain of the Goblin Empire at heart, there's a path in Anyship just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/6b30d0f6e8b8205cc27d3db41fad6601.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Point and Click!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeons and nautical exploration, explore villages, cities, and many other unique places. Visit taverns, buy and sell at stores, and meets tons of locals. You can even hire many of them for your crew or help them out in other ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/939e10437d58442d1c06ec73e9e8e2d6.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Dev</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahoy there! I'm a solo dev and I've been working on this game in my free time for the past decade and am beyond excited to share it with you! It's a continuation of a board game my brother and I created in the 4th grade with hand drawn cards and a big board so really this has been in progress for decades! The original board game was named Anyship since we each got a ship and crew to match our unique play styles. My cartoony art style is hand drawn on paper before scanning and coloring on my computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anyship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  submarine, hire a crew, and explore the Seven Seas! Choose between 10 different factions like pirates, the Goblin Empire, and the Royal Navy. Battle other crews, explore dungeons, craft, fish, and mine to fill your sub with treasure and score victory points before time runs out. Each playthrough generates a new procedurally generated world with endless possibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Seven Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game creates a new map to explore. But hurry, you only have so much time to gather gold and make it to your final destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/02a029cd7d8adc73e47b2e3c968085b5.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Submarine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build a steampunk submarine with over 18 different kinds of rooms to choose from. Build everything from harpoon guns and submarine bays, to a swimming pool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/cfb7100b7edb109c67fac5c0c0c74552.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovable Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a crew from a pool of over 20 lovable and unique characters, all with their own wants, fears, and dreams. Keep them well fed and paid or you may face a mutiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/089bc052ac39bfbd5c065a29c6bdb6d1.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, battle other crews, and don't forget to eat and drink! Death is permanent, but there are many more paths to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/712b2cfa3616ec0b17942d853bbbe37a.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Acquire Booty!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, steal, mine, craft, brew, and earn gold and treasures to gain victory points! High scores as different factions will unlock completely different and unique starts to future play throughs whether you're a bard, a marine, or a merciless captain of the Goblin Empire at heart, there's a path in Anyship just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/6b30d0f6e8b8205cc27d3db41fad6601.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Point and Click!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeons and nautical exploration, explore villages, cities, and many other unique places. Visit taverns, buy and sell at stores, and meets tons of locals. You can even hire many of them for your crew or help them out in other ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/extras/939e10437d58442d1c06ec73e9e8e2d6.avif?t=1788215913\" width=780 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Dev</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahoy there! I'm a solo dev and I've been working on this game in my free time for the past decade and am beyond excited to share it with you! It's a continuation of a board game my brother and I created in the 4th grade with hand drawn cards and a big board so really this has been in progress for decades! The original board game was named Anyship since we each got a ship and crew to match our unique play styles. My cartoony art style is hand drawn on paper before scanning and coloring on my computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build a submarine, hire a crew, and explore the Seven Seas! Choose between 10 different factions like pirates, the Goblin Empire, and the Royal Navy. Battle other crews, explore dungeons, craft, fish, smuggle, and mine to fill your sub with treasure and score victory points before time runs out.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/4ea34e0ba1b246f9e7c542aec134cfb21c01eb61/header.jpg?t=1788215913", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/24cdb1374a79ab2f3ad78ac88f42d55f8788a8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788215913", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5015860/24cdb1374a79ab2f3ad78ac88f42d55f8788a8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788215913", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD Dual-Core CPU (2.0 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  2 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommend